(7549680, 1209127, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes to the challenge well<br/> <br/>Another great image Ronnie. The dominant factor here is the lovely colour of the water reflecting the suns lovely warm colours, this together with the birds action and position all make for a very attractive image. However, as regards the challenge brief of motion panning the fast shutter speed and distance make for very little effect of panning, a significantly slower speed would have fulfilled the challenge brief more readily.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes to the challenge well Another great image Ronnie. The dominant factor here is the lovely colour of the water reflecting the suns lovely warm colours, this together with the birds action and position all make for a very attractive image. However, as regards the challenge brief of motion panning the fast shutter speed and distance make for very little effect of panning, a significantly slower speed would have fulfilled the challenge brief more readily.', '2017-12-24 16:46:16.000000', NULL, 0),
